      "title": "Count each integer and write it back as many times as it occurs",
      "explanation": "This simple implementation reconstructs the integer sequence from frequencies and discards the individual identities of equal values. A stable sort for objects with additional properties must retain those objects’ identities and place them in appropriate result positions."
